OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry with plenty of
OL,6,Fsunshine. Orkney will have a sunny
OL,7,Fmorning, with low risk of the odd
OL,8,Fshower in the afternoon. Patchy rain
OL,9,Fpossible for Shetland first thing in
OL,10,Fthe morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening with clear
OL,13,Fspells. Turning cloudier through the
OL,14,Fearly hours with the risk of a few
OL,15,Fspots of rain. Southerly winds will
OL,16,Fbecome fresh to strong.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
