OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBright but with a few showery
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain at first. Turning
OL,7,Fcloudier in the afternoon with
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,9,Facross from the southwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSouthwesterly winds persist through
OL,13,Fthis period and bring largely cloudy
OL,14,Fskies with outbreaks of rain and
OL,15,Fdrizzle at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
